       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. HANDSECT.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-I                PIC 9(4).
       01 WS-LEN              PIC S9(4) COMP VALUE 4.
       01 WS-MSG              PIC X(20).
       01 WS-TABLE.
          05 WS-ENTRY         PIC X(10) OCCURS 10.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       A000-MAIN SECTION.
           EXEC CICS RECEIVE INTO(WS-I) LENGTH(WS-LEN) END-EXEC
           PERFORM B000-TRANSFER
           MOVE 'X' TO WS-ENTRY(WS-I)
           EXEC CICS RETURN END-EXEC.
       B000-TRANSFER SECTION.
           EXEC CICS HANDLE CONDITION PGMIDERR(B000-NOTFOUND)
           END-EXEC
           EXEC CICS XCTL PROGRAM('NEXTPGM') END-EXEC.
       B000-NOTFOUND.
           MOVE 'NOT FOUND' TO WS-MSG.
       B000-EXIT.
           EXIT.
